(a) advisory, consultancy, suitability or financial-planning obligation;
(b) fiduciary, trustee, custodian, agency or broker duty;
(c) investment-management, portfolio-management or discretionary-trading obligation;
(d) obligation to monitor, supervise or conduct due diligence on the Counterparty's activities, decisions or transactions; or
(e) regulated activity or licensed function not expressly permitted by the Company's licences and agreed in this Agreement.
Exclusion of unstated expectations. Any feature, function, service, support, deliverable or performance level not expressly set out in this Agreement is excluded, and the Counterparty shall not rely on any oral representation, marketing material, demonstration, pilot or prior course of dealing as creating any such obligation.

